\f0\b\fs26 \cf2 \cb3 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
1. Most important is the virus.\'a0
\f1\b0 \cb1 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 I wanted to look at what would happen if someone created a really good/helpful virus.\'a0 How would the structure of power etc react.\'a0 I decided that the ultra wealthy would not want the virus to get out as a number of industries would be destroyed.\'a0\cf4 \
\
Do any characters express the POV of these industries?\
\
\cf2 Basically\'a0fuck the poor they can all die horribly, just as long as the money keeps flowing.\cb1 \
\
\cb3 Only a really shitty society would completely reject a virus of that nature.\'a0 So it is set in a\'a0dystopia\'a0where the poor are crushed under foot. (As George Orwell put it - "
\f2\i a boot stamping on a human face forever." ) 
\f1\i0 I have written that the Primary Trade Dominion rejects religion, but carries on with Business/Economic Theory as if it is religion - initially stealing Icons from religion as a recruitment tool (just like actual religions).\'a0 So they carry on like business is a religion and doctrinal divergence is not tolerated.\'a0 Death to anyone, airborne or cloud born, who challenges the structure of the Business Theology.\'a0\cb1 \
\
\cb3 I have called upon "Science and Reason" to undermine the structures of the PTD.\cb1 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

