\f0\b \cf2 \cb3 2. Evolution and The Dawkins\cf4  (27)
\f1\b0 \cf2 \cb1 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 The particular area of science and reason I have focussed upon is, of course, evolution and its clash with religion.\'a0 Evolution and religion are fundamentally\'a0opposed and cannot co-exist.\'a0 Whether Dawkins is the great prophet of the book or one of a number of prophets\'a0(Carl Sagan, Stephen Hawking, Christopher Hitchens.....the list could be very long.) is probably not vital, but I am still keen on someone becoming God.\'a0 (To become god all you have to do is save the universe or alter one of the universal constants or reverse engineer\'a0failed universes).\cb1 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

