\f0\b \cb3 4. The Disc\cf4  (~20)
\f1\b0 \cf2 \cb1 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 This "McGoober"\'a0\cf4 (McGuffin)\cf2  is important, but it does not necessarily have to be a disc.\'a0 It just has to have the capacity (or alleged capacity) of great destruction by messing with gravity and space-time.\'a0 As discussed it can have some feature that is most sought after - invisibility,\'a0 can slow down time or alter gravity on a localised level or make your dick big.\'a0 You know, something that everyone will think is interesting and of some considerable value.\'a0\cb1 \
\
\cb3 The "McGoober" has to be partially biological as its nature is altered when it is infected by the virus.\'a0 The alterations in the dics\'a0later allows Richard Dawkins to stop the cycle of failed Universes (boom and bust universes).\cb1 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

